<title>BAHRAIN: TABLE - Bahrain's Q1 M3 rises one pct qtr/qtr.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Bahrain's Q1 M3 rises one pct qtr/qtr.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahrain's broadly defined M3 money supply rose one percent in the first quarter of 1997 compared with three months earlier, Bahrain Monetary Agency figures show.</p>
<p>Detailed data (percentage changes over three months)</p>
<p>		 Jan 1997   Dec 1996   Sep 1996   June 1996</p>
<p> M3		+1.0	 +7.8	  -1.1	 +1.0</p>
<p> M2		+0.6	 +2.2	  -0.3	 +1.1</p>
<p>Monetary aggregates (million dinars)</p>
<p>		 Jan 1997   Dec 1996   Sep 1996   June 1996</p>
<p> M3	     1,928.5    1,947.8    1,806.1    1,826.3</p>
<p> M2	     1,447.0    1,437.9    1,406.8    1,411.2</p>
<p>-- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424.</p>
</text>
